{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIwL0ZyaWVkYSUyMENvbWluZyUyMEhvbWUlMjAlMjgyMDIwJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Frieda Coming Home","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/mHHlmK7XqAYBbtuEHEEUPkjuO3V.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wTHamEmVntA6W1GKHsKehp8IhTd.jpg","description":"A young American couple, Mark and Olivia, are expecting their first child. Before that, they want to make their dream of a trip to Europe come true. They book private accommodations through an Internet portal and embark on their 4-weeks-journey. On their arrival in Germany Elisabeth picks them up at the airport. She is the daughter of the landlady of Mark and Olivias first accommodation, a tiny house, located at a beautiful lake, in the hometown of Olivia's great-grandparents. They learn that the 82-years old landlady is in the hospital and dying. Elisabeth drives Mark and Olivia to the house. And then the two young people spend their first night in Germany. A night in which Mark gets to know the owner in a special way. The next morning, it is strangely quiet over the house by the lake. And no one will know so quickly what happened a few hours ago.\n\nRated NR · Released 25 Jan 2020 · Germany, United States of America · Language: English · 91 min\nStudio: XAMARAM Entertainment SE\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2020","genres":["Mystery","Thriller","Romance","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"4.8","runtime":"91 min","cast":["Elisabeth Kanettis","Timo Willman","Maike Jüttendonk","Steffen Gräbner","Madeleine Niesche","Errol Trotman-Harewood"],"director":["Michael W. Driesch"],"released":"2020-01-25T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Michael W. Driesch","character":"Director"},{"name":"Elisabeth Kanettis","character":"Olivia","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/fFLATpZzsv8KUqmXjWcWjrNqsFB.jpg"},{"name":"Timo Willman","character":"Mark"},{"name":"Maike Jüttendonk","character":"Young Gerda","photo":"ht